1
00:00:00,096 --> 00:00:02,150
Up to this point, everything we've done

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,650
lives in a folder on our computer. The

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,897
session we are working in is always related

4
00:00:07,897 --> 00:00:10,834
to a folder we grant Claude access to.

5
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:15,328
Your real work projects are typically spread

6
00:00:15,505 --> 00:00:18,218
across your apps, typically, so your emails,

7
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,149
your calendar,

