13
00:00:34,754 --> 00:00:37,702
This changes with connectors. Connectors

14
00:00:37,798 --> 00:00:40,762
give Claude access to your apps, direct

15
00:00:40,842 --> 00:00:43,549
access to Google Calendar, Slack, Notion,

