18
00:00:48,868 --> 00:00:51,912
new apps added regularly. Claude then talks

19
00:00:51,912 --> 00:00:54,428
to these services directly through their

20
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:55,084
APIs.

21
00:00:55,613 --> 00:00:57,824
So no copy-pasting, you don't have to

22
00:00:57,824 --> 00:00:59,799
download files first, Nothing like this.

23
00:01:00,749 --> 00:01:02,472
Setting up connectors is pretty

24
00:01:02,504 --> 00:01:03,277
straightforward.

25
00:01:03,873 --> 00:01:06,321
You can either select this plus button here

26
00:01:07,336 --> 00:01:09,003
