32
00:01:24,419 --> 00:01:26,818
Now to add a connector, you again have to

33
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,989
select the plus symbol up here.

34
00:01:29,679 --> 00:01:31,427
There you can either browse existing

35
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:35,534
connectors or add custom connectors via MCP,

36
00:01:35,775 --> 00:01:37,572
the Model Context Protocol,

37
00:01:38,406 --> 00:01:42,321
an open standard that lets any app expose

38
00:01:42,433 --> 00:01:43,893
its tools to Claude.

39
00:01:44,519 --> 00:01:47,839
Going deep on MCP is beyond the course focus

40
00:01:47,968 --> 00:01:48,738
at this stage,

