00:02:08,018 --> 00:02:08,436
connector.

48
00:02:09,239 --> 00:02:11,936
By selecting it, we can get an overview

49
00:02:12,514 --> 00:02:14,826
of the tools this connector has.

50
00:02:15,356 --> 00:02:18,198
So we can, for example, create draft emails,

51
00:02:18,632 --> 00:02:21,490
read messages, read threads, and search

52
00:02:21,522 --> 00:02:22,019
messages.

53
00:02:22,951 --> 00:02:24,123
And once we

