00:02:34,286 --> 00:02:35,780
connected to Gmail.

59
00:02:36,775 --> 00:02:39,505
Now, whenever using such connectors, such

60
00:02:39,649 --> 00:02:42,828
third-party applications, and giving AI,

61
00:02:43,262 --> 00:02:45,331
Claude in this case, access to these,

62
00:02:45,989 --> 00:02:48,794
you have to be very careful. We talked about

63
00:02:48,794 --> 00:02:51,327
security already, and this of course is a

64
00:02:51,375 --> 00:02:51,664
very

65
00:02:52,193 --> 00:02:53,475
sensitive topic here.

66
00:02:54,164 --> 00:02:57,803
Things can go wrong with AI. AI is not

67
00:02:57,868 --> 00:03:00,689
deterministic, so we have problems like

68
00:03:00,833 --> 00:03:04,039
prompt injection. Sometimes AI just isn't

69
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:06,524
doing what it's supposed to do. So always be

70
00:03:06,524 --> 00:03:07,518
careful when

71
00:03:08,127 --> 00:03:11,496
