the same, but maybe don't use your personal

76
00:03:21,754 --> 00:03:23,745
account with really important information,

77
00:03:24,355 --> 00:03:26,908
especially when playing around with tools

78
00:03:26,972 --> 00:03:27,791
like Cowork.

79
00:03:28,433 --> 00:03:31,033
In here, we can still change the

80
00:03:31,627 --> 00:03:34,630
